## ⚔️ Shell Comparison: Bash vs. Fish

| Feature | Bash | Fish |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Out-of-the-box Syntax Highlighting** | ❌ No |  Yes |
| **Auto-Spell Correction** | ❌ No |  Yes |
| **Syntax Style** | Standard / Traditional | Simple / Modern |
| **Visual Customization** | Standard | Cool themes & different colors |

### Key Features of Bash
1. **Scripting Capabilities**: Automate repetitive tasks easily.
2. **Completion Feature**: Press `Tab` to autocomplete commands and file paths.
3. **Command History**: Use the `Up` and `Down` arrow keys to cycle through previously logged commands.

